  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your magic becomes much like your dancing, absolutely confusing.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dances class feature, know the canterwauling dance,Wis 12</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You learn the lesser confusion spell as a 1st-level primordial dancer spell. This does not count toward the number of spells you can know of a particular level, nor can this spell be exchanged for a new spell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/primordial-dancer-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
